{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45064","headline":"奉陪郑使君谔游太湖至洞庭山登上真观却望湖水 · 皎然","name":"奉陪郑使君谔游太湖至洞庭山登上真观却望湖水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡斋得无事，放舟下南湖。\n湖中见仙邸，果与心赏俱。\n不远风物变，忽如寰宇殊。\n背云视层崖，别是登蓬壶。\n突兀盘水府，参差沓天衢。\n回瞻平芜尽，洪流豁中区。\n气吞江山势，色净氛霭无。\n灵长习水德，胜势当地枢。\n朝宗动归心，万里思鸿途。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}